and use as templates. 

Templating with Node.js: that also work, we can use modules, like export modules, etc.

fopen(): function to open file 

PHP_EOL (PHP End Of Line) - this is a constant within PHP, this will automatically add a 
end of line character and moves the cursor to the next line for us (i think this is how
it works...)

